{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#card-1","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Cture Image 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面端的图片生成插件，可在对话中调用 OpenAI 兼容图片 API。它注册文生图、参考图编辑和批量生成工具，并把图片以内嵌附件展示、保存到工作区。用户可设置模型、画质、分辨率、比例和保存目录，也可通过设置面板或配置工具管理接口。适合需要在 DSH 会话里制作或修改视觉素材的用户；使用前需配置图片 API 地址和密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:785-825","lib/host.js:1285-1287","lib/client.js:576-590"]}
{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#card-2","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Cture Image adds image generation to DSH conversations through an OpenAI-compatible API. Generate pictures, edit references, or process batches; results appear inline and originals are saved in the workspace. The settings panel controls the model, size, and quality. An API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:785-825","lib/host.js:1285-1287","lib/client.js:576-590"]}
