{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#feature-1","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cture Image 的「文生图」功能：把提示词提交给图片生成接口，可调整模型、画质、分辨率和宽高比。生成结果作为对话图片返回，并保存原始文件到工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:517-552","lib/host.js:620-639"]}
{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#feature-2","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cture Image 的「参考图编辑」功能：调用者提供工作区或绝对路径的图片及编辑指令，可选遮罩限定重绘区域；插件将图片以 multipart 形式提交并返回处理结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:805-813","lib/host.js:534-552"]}
{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#feature-3","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cture Image 的「批量生成」功能：提交多个提示词后，插件按配置的并发数分别请求图片接口，并将生成图片作为结果附件及工作区文件返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:814-817","lib/host.js:785-825"]}
{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#feature-4","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cture Image 的「会话内图片预览」功能：生成结果以图片内容块显示在对话中，客户端呈现预览、尺寸和下载按钮，方便查看或保存图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:628-639","lib/client.js:150-207"]}
{"unit_id":"Cikian__dsh-cture-image#caveat-1","repo":"Cikian/dsh-cture-image","commit":"51c203c2fd8be816ce52e88e41ea8587ccd765c4","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Cture Image 会把提示词以及编辑时提供的参考图发送到配置的图片 API；默认接口域名为 api.cikhub.com。生成图片原文件同时写入会话工作区，调用前需配置 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:43","lib/host.js:517-552","lib/host.js:628-639"]}
